# Type System Discipline

Make the compiler reject impossible states, mismatched primitives, and unhandled variants. Prefer defining errors and special cases out of existence over proliferating handlers. For TypeScript syntax, see the `typescript-best-practices` skill.

- **Brand semantic primitives.** `UserId` and `OrderId` are strings underneath but should not be interchangeable. Give each its own type, such as a branded intersection in TypeScript or a newtype elsewhere. Validate once at creation, trust the type downstream. If two arguments share a primitive type but mean different things, brand them.
- **External data is untyped until parsed.** RPC payloads, JSON, IPC messages, CLI args, config files, environment variables, database rows. Have a parse function at every boundary that turns unstructured input into the typed model. The **boundary-discipline** principle skill says where to put validation.
- **Derive types from authoritative schemas.** When a protocol buffer, OpenAPI spec, GraphQL schema, database migration, design-token file, or another file owns a shape, derive from it instead of hand-rolling a parallel type. See the **encode-lessons-in-structure** principle skill.
:root {
  --font-body: "Manrope Variable", sans-serif;
  --canvas: #000;
  --surface: #111;
  --text: #f0edf3;
  --muted: #ada6b4;
  --accent-member: #b67be5;
  --accent-funder: #64cfb5;
  --accent: var(--accent-member);
  --line: #28232e;
  --warning: #f0c17d;
  --action-ink: #160b1f;
  --space-1: 4px;
  --space-2: 8px;
  --space-3: 12px;
  --space-4: 16px;
  --space-6: 24px;
  --space-8: 32px;
  --radius-control: 6px;
  --text-small: 0.75rem;
  --text-body: 0.875rem;
  --text-heading: 1.375rem;
  --focus-width: 2px;
  --focus-offset: 4px;
}
:root {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  color: var(--text);
  background: var(--canvas);
  color-scheme: dark;
  font-synthesis: none;
  text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}
* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
body {
  margin: 0;
  min-width: 320px;
}
button,
input {
  font: inherit;
}
button,
a {
  -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
}
button {
  cursor: pointer;
}
a {
  color: inherit;
}
.ui-action {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: var(--space-2);
  min-height: 44px;
  padding: 10px 16px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: var(--radius-control);
  background: var(--surface);
  color: var(--text);
  font: inherit;
  font-size: var(--text-body);
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1.5;
  text-decoration: none;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.ui-action[data-size="large"] {
  min-height: 48px;
  padding: 12px 22px;
}
.ui-action[data-variant="primary"] {
  background: var(--accent);
  border-color: var(--accent);
  color: var(--action-ink);
}
.ui-action[data-variant="quiet"] {
  background: transparent;
  border-color: transparent;
  color: var(--accent);
  text-decoration: underline;
  text-underline-offset: 4px;
}
.ui-action:hover:not(:disabled) {
  border-color: var(--accent);
}
.ui-action[data-variant="primary"]:hover:not(:disabled) {
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent), white 15%);
}
.ui-action:focus-visible {
  outline: var(--focus-width) solid var(--accent);
  outline-offset: var(--focus-offset);
}
.ui-action:disabled {
  opacity: 0.4;
  cursor: default;
}

.ui-action[data-size="compact"] {
  min-height: 32px;
  padding: 6px 12px;
  font-size: 12px;
}
.ui-action[data-size="inline"] {
  min-height: 0;
  padding: 0;
  border: 0;
}
.ui-action[data-variant="subtle"] {
  border-color: #403149;
  background: #151019;
  color: #d2b0ed;
  border-radius: 5px;
}
.ui-action[data-variant="subtle"]:hover:not(:disabled) {
  background: #25182f;
  border-color: #785192;
}
.search-field {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 16px;
  padding: 0 22px;
  min-height: 74px;
  border: 1px solid #493553;
  border-radius: 10px;
  background: var(--surface);
  transition:
    border-color 120ms ease,
    box-shadow 120ms ease;
}
.search-field:focus-within {
  border-color: var(--accent);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #a863d61c;
}
.search-icon {
  display: flex;
  color: var(--muted);
  flex: none;
}
.search-field input {
  appearance: none;
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--text);
  border: 0;
  outline: none;
  min-width: 0;
  width: 100%;
  padding: 21px 0;
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 1.6;
  caret-color: var(--accent);
}
.search-field input::-webkit-search-cancel-button {
  display: none;
}
.search-field input::placeholder {
  color: #9c929f;
  font-weight: 400;
}
.search-shortcut {
  flex: none;
  white-space: nowrap;
  font: inherit;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--muted);
  border: 1px solid #453c4a;
  border-radius: 5px;
  min-width: 26px;
  padding: 2px 7px;
  text-align: center;
}
.clear-button {
  color: var(--muted);
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
  padding: 0;
  flex: none;
  border: 0;
  border-radius: 5px;
  background: transparent;
}
.clear-button:hover {
  color: var(--text);
  background: #2a2130;
}
.search-help {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 1.6;
  min-height: 20px;
  margin: 12px 2px 0;
}
.results-list,
.loading-rows {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
}
.loading-rows {
  width: 100%;
}
.entity-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 36px minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 18px;
  padding: 21px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
}
.entity-icon {
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  width: 36px;
  height: 36px;
  padding: 0;
  color: var(--accent);
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 40%, black);
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 20%, black);
}
.entity-kind {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-self: end;
  gap: 6px;
  max-width: 210px;
  padding: 4px 8px;
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 40%, black);
  border-radius: 6px;
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 20%, black);
  color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent), white 40%);
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 1.5;
}
.entity-kind svg {
  flex: none;
  color: var(--accent);
}
.entity-kind-label {
  min-width: 0;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}
.entity-indicator {
  position: relative;
  justify-self: start;
}
.entity-tooltip {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 1;
  top: 100%;
  left: 0;
  padding-top: 6px;
  width: max-content;
  max-width: min(280px, calc(100vw - 48px));
  pointer-events: auto;
}
.entity-tooltip > span {
  display: block;
  padding: 7px 10px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 5px;
  background: #19141f;
  color: var(--text);
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 16px #0008;
}
.message-state {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  flex-direction: column;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 48px 12px 44px;
}
.state-icon {
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  color: var(--muted);
  width: 52px;
  height: 52px;
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.message-state .message-title {
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  font-weight: 500;
  margin: 0 0 9px;
  max-width: 100%;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}
.message-state p {
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin: 0;
  color: var(--muted);
  max-width: 440px;
}
.loading-indicator {
  width: 14px;
  height: 14px;
  border: 2px solid var(--line);
  border-top-color: var(--muted);
  border-radius: 50%;
  animation: spin 900ms linear infinite;
}
.loading-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 18px;
  padding: 21px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
}
.skeleton-icon {
  width: 36px;
  height: 36px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  flex: none;
  background: #151119;
}
.skeleton-name {
  max-width: 350px;
  height: 13px;
  border-radius: 3px;
  background: #1c1622;
}
@media (max-width: 700px) {
  .search-field {
    min-height: 66px;
    padding: 0 16px;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .search-field input {
    font-size: 16px;
    padding: 18px 0;
  }
  .entity-row {
    gap: 12px;
  }
}
@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .search-shortcut {
    display: none;
  }
  .entity-row {
    grid-template-columns: 32px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 5px 12px;
    padding: 18px 0;
  }
  .entity-icon {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
  }
  .entity-kind {
    grid-column: 2;
    justify-self: start;
    max-width: 100%;
  }
}
.profile-type {
  display: inline-flex;
  gap: 10px;
  align-items: center;
  color: var(--accent);
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 600;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}
.declarations-list,
.funding-list {
  list-style: none;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}
.declarations-list {
  margin-top: 28px;
}
.declaration {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  padding: 24px 0 30px;
}
.declaration-heading {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: start;
  gap: 24px;
}
.declaration-heading h3 {
  margin: 0 0 6px;
  font-size: 17px;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1.5;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}
.funding-list {
  margin-top: 20px;
}
.value-row {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: start;
  gap: 24px;
  padding: 14px 18px;
  background: var(--surface);
  border-bottom: 1px solid #222;
}
.funding-source {
  min-width: 0;
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}
.funding-source span,
.funding-value span {
  display: block;
}
.funding-value {
  text-align: right;
  max-width: 50%;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.recorded-names {
  margin-bottom: 30px;
}
.recorded-names ul {
  margin: 0;
  padding-left: 20px;
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.8;
}
.recorded-names li {
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  white-space: pre-wrap;
}
.detail-message {
  padding: 32px 0 80px;
}
.detail-message p {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.8;
}
.detail-message .loading-indicator {
  display: block;
